# Git workflow: main only

- Work **directly on `main`**. Do not create feature branches.
- Do not open pull requests unless the user explicitly asks for one.
- Commit and push to `origin/main` as you go.
- If you are already on a feature branch when this rule applies, merge or cherry-pick onto `main`, push `main`, and stop using the branch.
- Branch/PR cloud-agent defaults do **not** override this rule for this repository.
